-[1440px]:tracking-[-3.96px]">S175
5.x MW Platform</h1><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><p class="font-semibold text-ever-teal-100 text-[28px] leading-[34px] tracking-[-1.12px] md:text-[36px] md:leading-[42px] md:tracking-[-1.44px] min-[1440px]:text-[40px] min-[1440px]:leading-[46px] min-[1440px]:tracking-[-1.6px]">The power of 10,000+ turbines in one</p><div class="flex flex-col gap-6 font-normal text-dark-2 text-[17px] leading-[26px] tracking-[-0.34px] md:text-[18px] md:leading-[28px] md:tracking-[-0.36px] min-[1440px]:text-[20px] min-[1440px]:leading-[28px] min-[1440px]:tracking-[-0.4px]"><p>As large-scale projects expand into lower-to-moderate wind regions, the S175 - one of our largest turbines yet - helps improve generation and strengthen site viability.</p><p>Part of Suzlon’s modular Blue Sky platform, it helps deliver more output from fewer turbines.</p></div></div></div><a href="#" class="group/viewall flex gap-[2px] items-center relative shrink-0 w-fit" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><div class="flex items-center justify-center p-3 sm:p-[16px] rounded-[4px] shrink-0 transition-all duration-300 border border-ever-teal-100 bg-ever-teal-80 text-white group-hover/viewall:bg-ever-teal-100"><span class="font-semibold leading-[16px] text-[12px] sm:text-[14px] tracking-[0.28px] whitespace-nowrap">Download Brochure</span></div><div class="relative size-[40px] shrink-0 overflow-hidden sm:size-[48px]"><img alt="" class="block h-full w-full max-w-none" src="/assets-f/img/3c12e21eafc6ec.svg" decoding="async"><div class="-translate-y-1/2 absolute h-[48px] left-0 right-0 top-1/2 transition-opacity duration-300 bg-ever-teal-100 opacity-0 group-hover/viewall:opacity-100" style="-webkit-mask-image:url("/assets-f/img/3c12e21eafc6ec.svg");mask-image:url("/assets-f/img/3c12e21eafc6ec.svg");-webkit-mask-size:100% 100%;mask-size:100% 100%;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-repeat:no-repeat"></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center"><div class="-translate-x