cle><article class="flex h-full min-w-0 flex-col gap-6 rounded-[16px] bg-white p-6 md:p-8 min-[1440px]:gap-8"><h3 class="whitespace-pre-line font-semibold text-ever-teal-100 text-[24px] leading-[30px] tracking-[-0.96px] md:text-[30px] md:leading-[36px] md:tracking-[-1.2px]">Commercial Value</h3><p class="font-normal text-dark-2 text-[16px] leading-[24px] tracking-[-0.32px]">Advanced aerodynamics and carbon girder blades help improve project returns and lower levelised energy costs.</p></article><article class="flex h-full min-w-0 flex-col gap-6 rounded-[16px] bg-white p-6 md:p-8 min-[1440px]:gap-8"><h3 class="whitespace-pre-line font-semibold text-ever-teal-100 text-[24px] leading-[30px] tracking-[-0.96px] md:text-[30px] md:leading-[36px] md:tracking-[-1.2px]">Reliability &amp;
Operations</h3><p class="font-normal text-dark-2 text-[16px] leading-[24px] tracking-[-0.32px]">Proven DFIG systems and modular platform architecture support dependable long-term operational performance.</p></article></div></div></div></div></div></section></main><footer class="w-full overflow-hidden bg-ever-teal-100"><div class="lg:hidden"><div class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-[428px] flex-col gap-12 px-6 py-[70px] sm:max-w-none"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-8"><a aria-label="Home" class="inline-block shrink-0 rounded-sm outline-none transition-opacity hover:opacity-90 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white/80 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-ever-teal-100" href="#"><img src="/assets-f/img/57e98e00ee7c2e.svg" alt="" class="h-8 w-[235px] max-w-full object-contain object-left"></a><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4"><a href="https://www.facebook.com/Suzlon" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Facebook" class="relative shrink-0 overflow-clip size-[24px]"><div class="absolute inset-[8.33%_27.08%_16.67%_29.17%]"><img alt="" src="/assets-f/img/cc782c56e6689e.svg" class="absolute inset-0 block size-full max-w-none"></div></a><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@suzlon" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="YouTube" class="relative shrink-0 overflow-clip size-[24px]"><div class="absolute inset-[16.67%_8.33%_16.67%_8.34%]"><img alt="" src="/assets-f/img/f18aff650849b5.svg" class="absolute inset-0 block size-full max-w-none"></div></a><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/suzlon-group/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="LinkedIn" class="relative shrink-0 overflow-clip size-[24px]"><div class="absolute inset-[14.58%_12.5%_12.5%_14.59%]"><img alt="" src="/assets-f/img/9c30287eedc526.svg" class="absolute inset-0 block size-full max-w-none"></div></a><a href="https://www.instagram.com/suzlongroup" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Instagram" class="relative shrink-0 overf